@page "/team"
@* UX-14: Team workload is a leadership *oversight* surface (gated ViewAllCases — the same gate as the
   Dashboard), so it lives in the Overview cluster beside the Dashboard rather than as a tab on the
   personal "My Work" page, where it was a category error (a team-wide view under a page named "My work"). *@
@attribute [Authorize(Policy = Policies.ViewAllCases)]

<PageTitle>Team workload</PageTitle>

<PageHeader Title="Team workload"
            Subtitle="Open-case distribution across the team, for rebalancing.">
    <Actions>
        @* Lateral links across the Overview cluster + a jump into the caller's own queue. *@
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href=""
           title="Go to the leadership dashboard">
            <span class="bi bi-speedometer2" aria-hidden="true"></span> Dashboard
        </a>
        <a class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" href="work"
           title="Go to your own open cases and after-action tasks">
            <span class="bi bi-person-workspace" aria-hidden="true"></span> My work
        </a>
    </Actions>
</PageHeader>

<TeamWorkloadPanel />
